  << /ActualText (A background spanning accounting\054 graphic design\054 and UX design\054 built on a belief that the best digital products come from understanding people first\056 That winding path was not accidental\073 each step sharpened a different part of how I think\072 analytically\054 visually\054 and with empathy at the centre\056 That same curiosity now extends into AI engineering\054 where I\047m learning to apply the same instinct\054 asking why before how\054 to how intelligent systems are designed and built\054 not just how they look and feel\056 I work well within cross\055functional teams while holding my own independently\056)
